// Source: https://github.com/sivolko/kql-library
// Collected: 2026-07-13
// KQL Library - https://github.com/sivolko/kql-library

SigninLogs
| where TimeGenerated > ago(1h)
| where ResultType != 0
| where isnotempty(IPAddress)
| summarize
    FailedAttempts = count(),
    FirstAttempt   = min(TimeGenerated),
    LastAttempt    = max(TimeGenerated)
    by IPAddress, UserPrincipalName
| where FailedAttempts >= 5
| order by FailedAttempts desc, LastAttempt desc

// ============================================================
// Tuning Notes:
// - Threshold of 5 is appropriate for a lab environment.
//   In production, consider 10+ depending on baseline noise.
// - Add TimeDelta to show attack velocity:
//   | extend TimeDelta = LastAttempt - FirstAttempt
// - Cross-reference IPs with threat intelligence:
//   | join kind=leftouter (ThreatIntelligenceIndicator
//     | where Active == true
//     | project TI_IP = NetworkIP, ThreatType)
//     on $left.IPAddress == $right.TI_IP
// - Difference from 5-minute version:
//   * This version: use for hunting and broad pattern detection
//   * 5-minute version: use in scheduled Sentinel analytic rules
// ============================================================